      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel that way; the sheer weight of the world's problems is exhausting. When everything feels so bleak, the idea of building a future seems utterly pointless. Maybe the most practical thing to do is to find a way to make the immediate, small things *not* feel so heavy. Sometimes, the only real control we have is over the quiet, deliberate choices we make for ourselves right now.",
      "source": "target",
